{{!-- THE CALL WINDOW (reworked 2026-09-19, user-ruled): one window for the whole call.

      ⭐ THE AIRCRAFT IMAGE is the sheet's own idiom — the profile-img element, data-edit="img", the
      platform's file browser — chosen PER CALL (no world setting: the gesture is opt-in by nature). The
      hidden input carries the chosen path to the confirm; the picture shows the built-in shape until
      one is picked. (A "use built-in shape" button shipped for a day and was removed on the user's
      word 2026-09-19 — a reload is the way back to the shape, and nobody needs it mid-session.)

      ⭐ THE CREW TOGGLE gates the squad list. Its tooltip sits on the TEXT SPAN ONLY (user ruling:
      "the tooltip shows when hovering the text, not the checkbox … just over the text itself").

      ⭐ THE SQUAD LIST is rows of actor + count, in step-off order. Rows are cloned from the hidden
      PROTOTYPE ROW below by the tool's render wiring (initial rows included), so the row's markup lives
      HERE and nowhere in JS. (A <template> element was the first draft; the dialog's render strips it,
      rig-proven 2026-09-19, so the prototype is an ordinary hidden node outside the rows list.)
      Dropping an actor from the sidebar anywhere on this window adds a row.

      ⛔ THE LIST IS THE WORLD'S OWN ACTORS. This module bundles no NPC and names none — the referee
      supplies the figures, which is what keeps the feature clear of shipped stat blocks. --}}
<div class="cp-tt-crew-body">
    <div class="cp-tt-av flexrow">
        <img class="profile-img cp-tt-av-img" src="{{img}}" data-edit="img" alt="{{CPLocal 'TraumaTeamImageLabel'}}" data-tooltip="{{CPLocal 'TraumaTeamImageTip'}}"/>
        <input type="hidden" name="cp-tt-img" value="{{imgValue}}"/>
        <div class="cp-tt-av-text">
            <span class="cp-tt-av-label">{{CPLocal "TraumaTeamImageLabel"}}</span>
            <p class="cp-tt-crew-hint">{{CPLocal "TraumaTeamImageHint"}}</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <label class="cp-tt-crew-toggle">
        <input type="checkbox" name="cp-tt-crew-on" {{#if crewOn}}checked{{/if}}/>
        <span class="cp-tt-tip" data-tooltip="{{CPLocal 'TraumaTeamCrewOnTip'}}">{{CPLocal "TraumaTeamCrewOnLabel"}}</span>
    </label>
    <div class="cp-tt-squad{{#unless crewOn}} cp-hidden{{/unless}}">
        <p class="cp-tt-crew-hint">{{CPLocal "TraumaTeamCrewHint"}}</p>
        <div class="cp-tt-rows"></div>
        <div class="cp-tt-squad-foot flexrow">
            <button type="button" class="cp-tt-row-add">{{CPLocal "TraumaTeamCrewAddRow"}}</button>
            <span class="cp-tt-seats"></span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cp-tt-row-proto-holder cp-hidden">
        <div class="cp-tt-row cp-tt-row-proto flexrow">
            <select class="cp-tt-row-actor cp2020ae-install-picker" data-tooltip="{{CPLocal 'TraumaTeamCrewActorTip'}}">
                <option value="">{{CPLocal "TraumaTeamCrewPick"}}</option>
                {{#each actors}}
                <option value="{{id}}">{{name}}</option>
                {{/each}}
            </select>
            <input type="number" class="cp-tt-row-count" value="1" min="1" step="1" data-tooltip="{{CPLocal 'TraumaTeamCrewCountTip'}}"/>
            <button type="button" class="cp-tt-row-remove" data-tooltip="{{CPLocal 'TraumaTeamCrewRemoveRow'}}">✕</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
